 "result": "The failing call is `response.set_cookie(...)` at `src/tessel/sessions.py:374`, inside `persist_session`. That is the line the traceback points to.\n\nThe rejected argument is **`partitioned=partitioned`**, passed on line 382 of that call. The value comes from `self.get_cookie_partitioned(app)` (line 344). Werkzeug 3.0.3's `Response.set_cookie()` has no `partitioned` parameter, hence `TypeError: ... unexpected keyword argument 'partitioned'`.\n\nThe same argument is also passed to `response.delete_cookie(...)` at line 361, in the empty-session branch. That would likely fail the same way, but the tests only hit the `set_cookie` path.",
